1035
00:38:53,870 --> 00:38:56,470
I think our version is more impactful.

1036
00:38:56,470 --> 00:38:57,840
If he pulls off the finger flick dance..

1037
00:38:57,840 --> 00:38:59,410
completely...

1038
00:38:59,410 --> 00:39:00,740
Then it'll go viral.

1039
00:39:00,740 --> 00:39:01,980
